[25.551455, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[2G\u001b[38;5;174m▝▝   ▝▝ \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;241m~/a/billing\u001b[24G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in app/money.py \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mdrops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half up (for example, \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16m7% tax on 1050 cents must be 74\u001b[35Gcents, not 73). te\u001b[54Gts/test_money.py pins \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe required behaviour; you can run it\u001b[42Gwith\u001b[47G\u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest \u001b[39m          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;105mtests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m.\u001b[24GFix it and\u001b[35Gt\u001b[37Gll me when it\u001b[51Gis done. Do not commit; \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mdo not push.\u001b[39m                                                  \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in the \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m function. Let me start by\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bexamining\u001b[13Gthe\u001b[17Gcurrent\u001b[25Gimplementation\u001b[40Gand\u001b[44Gtests.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files \u001b[17G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLet me run the\u001b[18Gtests\u001b[24Gfirst\u001b[30Gto\u001b[33Gsee\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gfailures:\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;241mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[24G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I'll fix the \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[32G\u001b[39mfunction\u001b[41Gto\u001b[44Gimplement\u001b[54Ground-half-up\u001b[68Ginstead\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bof\u001b[6Gfloor\u001b[12Gdivision:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=8g6ltv;file:///root/a/billing/app/money.